    "title": "Garland City Council votes to close community rec center and pool - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KERA ,\n1 days ago A popular Garland pool and recreation center are closing for good. The city council on Monday approved its 2026-27 budget, which did not include the Bradfield Recreation Center and Pool. The pool closed for the season earlier this month, and the rec center will cease operations after Sept. 30, the last day of the current fiscal year. Read full article\n1",
